#. type: Content of: <sect1><para>
#: blfs-en/kde/kf6/kf6-frameworks.xml:26
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"KDE Frameworks is a collection of libraries based on top of Qt6 and QML "
"derived from the previous KDE libraries. They can be used independent of the"
" KDE Display Environment (Plasma 6)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><para>
#: blfs-en/kde/kf6/kf6-frameworks.xml:34
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The instructions below build all of the KDE Frameworks packages in one step "
"by using a bash script."
msgstr ""

